"exploration"], "long_description": "Enter a high tension containment facility where every decision matters and every mistake can end the run.\n\nSCP Breach Event throws you into a dangerous research complex where unknown anomalies have escaped containment. Your goal is simple on paper but far from easy in practice survive, explore, and restore control before everything collapses.\n\nMovement is fully built around gorilla tag locomotion, letting you climb, swing, and move through the environment in a physical and immersive way that makes every chase and escape feel real. You are not just walking through corridors you are moving through them with your own hands.\n\nInside the facility, progress is controlled through a keycard system. Different security levels unlock different sections of the map, forcing you to search, explore, and risk deeper zones of the facility to gain access to higher clearance areas. Every door could be a safe passage or a dead end hiding something dangerous behind it.\n\nAt the core of the experience is the generator system. The facility relies on it to maintain containment protocols and power essential security systems. If the generator shuts down, everything changes immediately. All locked doors open across the entire facility, containment systems fail, and nowhere is safe anymore. The environment becomes unpredictable and hostile, forcing players to react fast, locate the generator, and bring it back online before total collapse.\n\nThe game is designed with high quality visuals.", "short_description": "SCP Breach Event is a fast paced VR horror experience built around intense movement and survival. Using gorilla tag style locomotion you climb, run, and escape through highly detailed facility environments while anomalies break containment and hunt you down. Work together or survive alone as you explore a collapsing research site filled with danger around every corner. The immersive visuals and reactive environments create a constant sense of tension where every decision matters and nowhere feel"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scpbreachevent/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Floppa", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scpbreachevent/homepage", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25850593427953378"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1986470592254680"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1986470592254680"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1777761600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1986470592254680"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27381147871564585", "version": "0.94"}, "id": "873264662439680", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25850593377953383", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27381147871564585"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"no